      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'll second this, for performance reasons.\nMinimizing the window increase FPS by about 2-10 FPS. It's not much, but it's definitely worth it. \nHaving the option to just not have the program render anything at all other than maybe a black screen with the words \"VRC\" would also be welcome---something just enough that you can select it and give it focus for the times you need to paste links into VRC.",
